**Share one timeout budget between draft reuse and fallback cleanup.**

When a matching live draft consumes the configured timeout and returns `null`, this handler starts `CleanAsync` with a new full timeout. A five-second setting can therefore delay finalization for about ten seconds. Start one deadline before `ReuseAsync` and pass the remaining time to fallback cleanup. Preserve `0` as unlimited, and do not treat caller cancellation as timeout.

